[
  {
    "id": "tab-demo-traffic",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "01 Traffic Light",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "# 01 Traffic Light\n\n最基础的 SCXML 循环：red → green → yellow → red。\n\n- 点 **next** 推进一个状态；\n- 点 **reset** 从初始态 red 重建会话；\n- scxml-out 同时输出状态、变量和 topic；\n- 打开机器配置，可用三张表 / actions 弹窗编辑；\n- 打开右侧 **状态机** 侧栏看只读实时图。\n\n覆盖：基础状态转移、entry action、变量、reset、监控。"
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-traffic-help",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "tab-demo-traffic",
    "name": "说明",
    "info": "next 推进；reset 回到 red。状态/变量分别接 debug。",
    "x": 80,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-traffic-conf",
    "type": "scxml-machine",
    "z": "tab-demo-traffic",
    "name": "Traffic Light",
    "source": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"red\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"cycles\" expr=\"0\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"red\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"cycles\" expr=\"cycles + 1\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"next\" target=\"green\"/>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"green\"><transition event=\"next\" target=\"yellow\"/></state>\n  <state id=\"yellow\"><transition event=\"next\" target=\"red\"/></state>\n</scxml>",
    "engine": "sandboxed",
    "scriptTimeoutMs": 500,
    "maxMicrosteps": 10000,
    "monitorShowVars": false,
    "persistVars": false,
    "updateEvent": "update",
    "x": 160,
    "y": 160,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
