  {
    "id": "tab-demo-commands",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "02 Commands & Guards",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "# 02 Commands & Guards\n\n演示 msg.command、变量、条件转移和 actions。\n\n- **start**（temp=20）→ cooling，并触发图内 send started；\n- **set temp=15** → 自动补 update → heating；\n- **set temp=25** → cooling；\n- **done** → 回 idle；\n- **reset** → 从初始态重建。\n\n覆盖：set / reset / event、updateEvent、cond、assign、send(data-expr)、stateTopic/eventTopic、变量调试。"
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-cmd-help",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "tab-demo-commands",
    "name": "说明",
    "info": "先点 start；再点 set temp=15 / 25；done 回 idle。",
    "x": 80,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-cmd-conf",
    "type": "scxml-machine",
    "z": "tab-demo-commands",
    "name": "HVAC Guard",
    "source": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"temp\" expr=\"20\"/>\n    <data id=\"mode\" expr=\"'idle'\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'idle'\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"start\" cond=\"temp &lt; 18\" target=\"heating\">\n      <assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'heating'\"/>\n      <send event=\"started\" data-expr=\"{mode: mode, temp: temp}\"/>\n    </transition>\n    <transition event=\"start\" cond=\"temp &gt;= 18\" target=\"cooling\">\n      <assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'cooling'\"/>\n      <send event=\"started\" data-expr=\"{mode: mode, temp: temp}\"/>\n    </transition>\n    <transition event=\"update\" cond=\"temp &lt; 18\" target=\"heating\"/>\n    <transition event=\"update\" cond=\"temp &gt;= 18\" target=\"cooling\"/>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"heating\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'heating'\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"done\" target=\"idle\"><assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'done'\"/></transition>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"cooling\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'cooling'\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"done\" target=\"idle\"><assign location=\"mode\" expr=\"'done'\"/></transition>\n  </state>\n</scxml>",
    "engine": "sandboxed",
    "scriptTimeoutMs": 500,
    "maxMicrosteps": 10000,
    "monitorShowVars": false,
    "persistVars": false,
    "updateEvent": "update",
    "x": 180,
    "y": 160,
    "wires": []
  },
