  {
    "id": "tab-demo-parallel",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "03 Parallel & History",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "# 03 Parallel & History\n\n两个独立机器：\n\n- **Parallel Plant**：power / network 两个并行区域，状态输出是数组；\n- **History Player**：open → details → pause → resume 恢复 details；back 回 home。\n\n覆盖：parallel、active state 数组、shallow history、两个 config node 独立会话。"
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-par-help",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "tab-demo-parallel",
    "name": "说明",
    "info": "Parallel 的 states 是数组；History 演示 pause/resume。",
    "x": 80,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "demo-par-conf",
    "type": "scxml-machine",
    "z": "tab-demo-parallel",
    "name": "Parallel Plant",
    "source": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"p\">\n  <parallel id=\"p\">\n    <state id=\"power\" initial=\"off\">\n      <state id=\"off\"><transition event=\"togglePower\" target=\"on\"/></state>\n      <state id=\"on\"><transition event=\"togglePower\" target=\"off\"/></state>\n    </state>\n    <state id=\"network\" initial=\"disconnected\">\n      <state id=\"disconnected\"><transition event=\"connect\" target=\"connected\"/></state>\n      <state id=\"connected\"><transition event=\"disconnect\" target=\"disconnected\"/></state>\n    </state>\n  </parallel>\n</scxml>",
    "engine": "sandboxed",
    "scriptTimeoutMs": 500,
    "maxMicrosteps": 10000,
    "monitorShowVars": false,
    "persistVars": false,
    "updateEvent": "update",
    "x": 160,
